=== function getStory() ===
~ return "{~A storm most wretched! Thanks be to Njord for gifting us passage through the treacherous waters!|For a storm like that to be struck at us, one of us must have offended Thor greatly. I suggest we find them and offer them as Sacrifice! I jest, of course.|We have set up camp here for now, but soon we need to move deeper. If for nothing else, then our food and supplies will run out eventually.|In my journeys out to sea, I’ve ne’er seen a storm like that in my life.|All of a sudden, I have begun to miss my home… I wonder why.|Brave Alfarr, taken by the waves. The sea truly holds all men equal.|It’s not all too often one finds new land; we should be honoured to do so. Yet there is something which feels off about this place…|My dearest {getName()}, once I return home, I shall have a tale most exciting to tell you.}"
=== function getName() ===
~ return "{~Stáli|Einarr|Agni|Brynhildr|Fríða|Katla|Auðr|Áshildr|Birna|Dagrún|Gunna|Helga|Hildr|Inga|Ingríðr}"